   "detailed_description": "<h1>數位豪華版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/18c7e7583bf530913d4febf628e9572b.avif?t=1792146147\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras_big/18c7e7583bf530913d4febf628e9572b.avif?t=1792146147 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >版本內容：</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「DP-53自由救世主」裝甲套組。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「人民意志」披肩。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「MP-98騎士」武器。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「超級公民」狀態。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >戰略配備英雄戰艦遊戲。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >高級戰爭債券代幣。</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/fb8876ccfdce9b8ec3b4e594c903b1fa.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/fb8876ccfdce9b8ec3b4e594c903b1fa.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/fb8876ccfdce9b8ec3b4e594c903b1fa.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>銀河最後一道進攻線。<br><br>加入絕地戰兵的行列，在狂暴的快節奏第三人稱射擊遊戲中，穿梭戰火瀰漫的銀河系，為自由而戰。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/4fb677a524eaf9318620399defcc00b4.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/4fb677a524eaf9318620399defcc00b4.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/4fb677a524eaf9318620399defcc00b4.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >緊急廣播：超級地球武裝部隊</h2>自由、和平、民主。<br>這些是超級地球公民與生俱來的權利，文明的重要支柱，<br>也是我們生存的本質。<br>但戰況越演越烈，一切再次受到威脅。<br>加入銀河前所未見的最強軍隊，打造安全自由的環境，使人們安居樂業。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/35ca28196240c0a23e7b3f1e9f21104f.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/35ca28196240c0a23e7b3f1e9f21104f.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/35ca28196240c0a23e7b3f1e9f21104f.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >成為傳奇</h2>您會成為絕地戰兵四人小隊的一員，並獲派策略性任務。<br>互相支援，友方炮火雖是戰爭中難以避免的遺憾，但唯有齊心合作才能團結致勝。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/ed035f1ca25e13a4b37838ad0a93c7ad.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/ed035f1ca25e13a4b37838ad0a93c7ad.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/ed035f1ca25e13a4b37838ad0a93c7ad.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >裝備配置</h2>為敵人送上自由的砲火，潛入敵人領地，或咬緊牙關、一馬當先衝鋒陷陣。<br>您可以任意選擇傳播自由的方式；運用各種的爆炸性火力、救命裝甲和足以扭轉戰況的戰略配備，亦即絕地戰兵軍火庫中的法寶。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/073978e84f89d3c2cb173bf4e92facaa.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/073978e84f89d3c2cb173bf4e92facaa.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/073978e84f89d3c2cb173bf4e92facaa.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >徵用</h2>超級地球會為您的英勇表現授予徵用點數。利用這項機制換取為自己、小隊、驅逐艦和整體戰況帶來助益的獎勵。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/6d14a34ac01cedb5822b1786c3a00b61.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/6d14a34ac01cedb5822b1786c3a00b61.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/6d14a34ac01cedb5822b1786c3a00b61.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >威脅</h2>每顆星球上的一切都恨不得將您置於死地，這就是您面臨的狀況。<br>每個敵人都有獨特且無法預測的特性、戰術和行為。他們唯一的共通點，就是殘暴、無所畏懼，且毫無道德。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/2f228b6f119f7d9207d351d5393cabea.poster.avif?t=1792146147\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/2f228b6f119f7d9207d351d5393cabea.webm?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/553850/extras/2f228b6f119f7d9207d351d5393cabea.mp4?t=1792146147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >銀河戰爭</h2>占領敵軍的星球、抵禦外侮並完成任務能壯大我們的整體戰績。<br>這場戰役的勝敗完全取決於參與的每一個人。<br>共同進退，不成功便成仁。",
